{
  "title": "Capicola",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "Live time-stretch",
        "and pitch-shift.",
        "",
        "Input is reduced to",
        "keyframes (local",
        "extrema) and replayed",
        "by a lagging read",
        "head. Transients snap",
        "the head back to now",
        "with a crossfade, so",
        "tails ring out while",
        "rhythm stays locked",
        "to the input.",
        "",
        "A MIDI note also",
        "forces a splice on",
        "both channels, even",
        "at the mute setting."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Main Page",
      "lines": [
        "Pitch: +/-12 st,",
        " +/-0.2 st snaps to 0",
        "",
        "Stretch: CCW=live,",
        " noon ~6x slower,",
        " CW=freeze",
        "",
        "Threshold: transient",
        " pickiness. A ratio",
        " over the signal's",
        " own running level,",
        " not an absolute one.",
        " Top of range mutes",
        " auto-trigger; a MIDI",
        " note still splices.",
        "",
        "Grain: splice leash",
        " length, in keyframes",
        "",
        "Quality: keyframe",
        " density. CCW=crunchy",
        " and sparse, CW=max",
        " fidelity",
        "",
        "Feedback: 0 to 1.5.",
        " Above 1.0 is",
        " unstable on purpose"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Secondary Page",
      "lines": [
        "Smoothing: envelope",
        " follower speed",
        "",
        "Fade: 10-250 ms.",
        " This is three things",
        " at once: wet path",
        " latency, splice",
        " crossfade length,",
        " and fastest splice",
        " rate. Short=snappy",
        " and clicky, long=",
        " smeared and washy.",
        "",
        "Drive: waveshaper.",
        " Applied to keyframes",
        " before interp, so",
        " it cannot alias.",
        " Push it as hard as",
        " you like.",
        "",
        "Character: quake to",
        " clean to sinc",
        "",
        "Mix: dry/wet blend",
        "",
        "Fb Tone: feedback",
        " path tone"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Mod Depth Page",
      "lines": [
        "Six bipolar depths,",
        "one per Main page",
        "knob: pitch, stretch,",
        "threshold, grain,",
        "quality, feedback.",
        "",
        "Center = off.",
        "",
        "Applied before each",
        "param's taper, so",
        "depth means the same",
        "thing across the",
        "whole sweep."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Mod Source Page",
      "lines": [
        "Six selectors, one",
        "per Main page knob.",
        "",
        "Input Env or",
        "Output Env.",
        "",
        "Default is Output",
        "Env: raising a depth",
        "alone closes a loop",
        "through the module's",
        "own output level.",
        "This is upstream's",
        "factory default and",
        "a big part of the",
        "character."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Credit",
      "lines": [
        "Port of capicola by",
        "Heavylight Ind.",
        "",
        "Based on their DAFx26",
        "paper, Keyframe Time",
        "Stretching via",
        "Extrema Sampling.",
        "",
        "DSP core vendored",
        "unmodified.",
        "",
        "License: AGPL-3.0"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
